index":96,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14ed-db0e-11ef-990f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魏揚州治壽春，晉平吳，乃移治秣陵。揚者，江南之氣躁勁，厥性輕揚。亦曰：州界多水，水波揚也。統丹楊、宣城、淮南、廬陵、廬江、毗陵、吳、吳興、會稽、東陽、新安、臨海、建安、晉安、豫章、臨川、鄱陽、南康，凡十八郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"魏扬州治寿春，晋平吴，乃移治秣陵。扬者，江南之气躁劲，厥性轻扬。亦曰：州界多水，水波扬也。统丹杨、宣城、淮南、庐陵、庐江、毗陵、吴、吴兴、会稽、东阳、新安、临海、建安、晋安、豫章、临川、鄱阳、南康，凡十八郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14d4-db0e-11ef-94cc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"揚州刺史","official_note":"揚州刺史是晉朝的地方行政長官，負責管理揚州地區的民政和軍事事務。在上下文中，周浚擔任此職，負責平定吳地未服者的寇亂，並推行威惠政策以安撫吳人。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"揚州刺史周浚移鎭秣陵","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"ffd168bc-fafb-4f4e-b818-1affb9456229"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":289,"link_td_description":"周浚，字开林，汝南安城人。西晋将领，官至安东将军、都督扬州诸军事。曾参与晋灭吴之战。","link_td_id":"Q10017553","link_td_number_id":5154248,"people_name":"周浚","people_name_jianti_auto":"周浚","people_xingming":"周浚","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14ee-db0e-11ef-bbbc-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":289,"link_td_description":"周浚，字开林，汝南安城人。西晋将领，官至安东将军、都督扬州诸军事。曾参与晋灭吴之战。","link_td_id":"Q10017553","link_td_number_id":5154248,"people_name":"浚","people_name_jianti_auto":"浚","people_xingming":"周浚","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14f1-db0e-11ef-8232-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"揚州","place_name_jianti_auto":"扬州","resolved_place_entity_id":155,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14ef-db0e-11ef-9f71-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秣陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"秣陵","resolved_place_entity_id":2337,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14f0-db0e-11ef-ad30-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","resolved_place_entity_id":33,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14f2-db0e-11ef-95eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","resolved_place_entity_id":33,"start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14f3-db0e-11ef-81ac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"晋灭吴之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0690"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事","内政","人事"],"content":"4是歲，揚州刺史周浚移鎭秣陵。吳民之未服者，屢爲寇亂，浚皆討平之；賓禮故老，搜求俊乂，威惠並行，吳人悅服。","content_fanyi":"这一年，扬州刺史周浚将治所迁至秣陵。吴地尚未归服的百姓时常骚扰劫掠，周浚都予以讨平；他以宾客之礼对待元老旧臣，搜求才俊，恩威并用，吴地民众心悦诚服。","content_jianti_auto":"4是岁，扬州刺史周浚移镇秣陵。吴民之未服者，屡为寇乱，浚皆讨平之；宾礼故老，搜求俊乂，威惠并行，吴人悦服。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":6948,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9cfb14d3-db0e-11ef-9bd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二年","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9cfad973-db0e-11ef-a6ee-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（辛丑、二八一）","year_int":281},"message":"success","success":true}